# Schiffsanlegestelle pier deck (solid): plank edge with a light o lip,
# O planks with l joints, l stringer; below it the lake (T shadow under
# the deck, then the same rows as tile_wolfgangsee_water) and one o O l
# post per tile. Open ends (left/right) get end grain and the post moves
# to the end so the pier reads as a separate jetty segment.
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
# Only the left/right bits change the look.
sprite = tile_jetty
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
